{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202430","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202430","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1120243001:0":{"text":"Whatever the case, Kojin isn't quite mature enough. And his roots in the clan are weak...","source_cn":"不过不管怎么说，库金的实力应该还欠点火候。在族内的根基...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37BF74DB2886E685","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1120243002:0":{"text":"On the contrary, I see great potential in him.","source_cn":"我倒觉得，库金是个很有潜力的年轻人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D87BF9C5172803A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120243003:0":{"text":"After all, the future belongs to the youth. As one gets older, one tends to grow arrogant and stubborn...","source_cn":"未来终究是属于年轻人的。人上了年纪啊，就容易变得固执和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF44A91EF2B98D104","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120243004:0":{"text":"It's about time the Grimmaw Clan had a young leader.","source_cn":"黑嚎也是时候该出一个年轻的领导者了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B3057F96011AC66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:担忧的黑嚎中年":{"text":"Worried Mauler","source":"担忧的黑嚎中年","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:智慧的黑嚎老者":{"text":"Grimmaw Elder","source":"智慧的黑嚎老者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}